{"id": "t132-001", "text": "Coffee with Ethan. He's still living in Leeds but moved to the other side of town. Works at the council now, planning dept. His sister Rebecca has two kids, both at the same primary.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "living in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "moved to the other side of town", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works at the council", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "planning dept", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "has two kids", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the same primary", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t132-002", "text": "Carmen's gone vegan since summer, properly strict, no honey even. Her partner Aidan still eats everything. They're hosting dinner Saturday and she's nervous about feeding his parents. Remind me to bring something without dairy. She has also stopped drinking, and Aidan's dad is diabetic so pudding needs thinking about. Aidan says just bring wine for his mum, she likes a dry white.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since summer"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "no honey", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "eats everything", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "bring something without dairy", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "stopped drinking", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "diabetic", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "dry white", "owner": "r3"}]}
{"id": "t132-003", "text": "Long call with Karim. Arsenal season ticket renewed again, he's been going since he was nine with his dad. His dad's knee op is sometime next week so he'll miss the derby. Should text Karim on Friday to see how the op went. He's also got into darts, plays in a pub league on Tuesdays, and reckons he'll win the cup over the summer.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Arsenal", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "season ticket", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was nine"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Karim", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "darts", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "plays in a pub league", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesdays"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cup", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t132-004", "text": "Imani is knitting a blanket for her niece, been at it since early March. Says she's only halfway. Also joined a book club at the library, they're doing Middlemarch which she hates.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since early March"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "book club at the library", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Middlemarch", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t132-005", "text": "Naledi lives in Woodstock now, near the old brewery. Works remote for a Dutch logistics firm. Her mum lives with them since her dad passed. Has a son, Mandla, he's 14.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Naledi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Woodstock", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "near the old brewery", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works remote for a Dutch logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives with them", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mandla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "14", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t132-007", "text": "Vikram coeliac, Shreya his wife allergic to shellfish. Note for when they come round.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vikram", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to shellfish", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they come round"}]}
{"id": "t132-009", "text": "Chatted to Mehmet after the match. He plays bass in a covers band, mostly 90s Britpop. They've got a gig at the Crown next Thursday. Anika (his girlfriend) says he's been practising every night. Don't forget to ask Mehmet how the gig went. Mehmet's also learning Turkish saz from his uncle, wants to work some of it into the set eventually.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bass", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "90s Britpop", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig at the Crown", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anika", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Mehmet how the gig went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Turkish saz", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "uncle", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to work some of it into the set", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "eventually"}]}
{"id": "t132-012", "text": "Niamh and Matteo had the baby! Little girl, born Sunday. Must send flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niamh", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matteo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Little girl", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t132-014", "text": "Adriana mentioned she's struggling with the new manager at work, thinking about leaving over the summer. She's a nurse at St Thomas's, been there eight years. I should call her next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adriana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the new manager", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nurse at St Thomas's", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "been there eight years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t132-024", "text": "Rebecca Schmidt from work: vegetarian, no nuts (serious allergy, carries an EpiPen). Loves oolong tea. Lives in Ealing with her husband and three kids.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rebecca Schmidt", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "no nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "serious allergy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "carries an EpiPen", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "oolong tea", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "Lives in Ealing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t132-033", "text": "Shreya's into bouldering, goes three times a week. Her climbing partner Rohan is the guy who works at the bike shop on Mill Road. They're both vegetarian.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "bouldering", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times a week"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "climbing partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the bike shop", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t132-035", "text": "Run 5k three times this week. Meal prep Sunday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Run 5k", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three times this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Meal prep", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t132-037", "text": "Oliver plays the cello in a community orchestra, they rehearse Thursdays. Concert is early March, Elgar. His girlfriend Hoang is a violinist in the same orchestra, that's how they met.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "community orchestra", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursdays"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Concert", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hoang", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "violinist in the same orchestra", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t132-038", "text": "Delroy's cooking a jerk chicken thing for the whole street on Saturday, it's his annual one. His mum Mrs Williams is coming down from Birmingham. He's asked everyone to bring drinks, he likes Red Stripe.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "jerk chicken thing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Williams", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Birmingham", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Red Stripe", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t132-039", "text": "Carmen said her brother Ethan has moved in with them temporarily, between jobs. He's applying for a teaching post. Interview is next Friday. Remind me to ask Carmen how Ethan's interview went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "moved in with them temporarily", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "between jobs", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "applying for a teaching post", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Interview", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Carmen how Ethan's interview went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ethan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t132-040", "text": "Agnieszka knits, crochets, does everything with yarn. Has a stall at the craft fair over Christmas. Her daughter Eva does the online shop. Karim says they're thinking of moving out of the flat before the baby, maybe end of the month they'll start viewing places. I should get them something for the baby, maybe a sling.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Agnieszka", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knits", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "crochets", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "stall at the craft fair", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eva", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "does the online shop", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out of the flat", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before the baby", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing places", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them something for the baby", "owner": "p3", "anchor": "e4", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}]}
{"id": "t132-041", "text": "Rachel Kaur is pregnant, due early March! Second one. Her husband Karim's over the moon. She's had awful morning sickness though.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel Kaur", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Second one", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "awful morning sickness", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}]}
{"id": "t132-045", "text": "Olga's son Aidan just started at uni in Glasgow, studying architecture. She misses him a lot. Should check how he's settling in when I see her next month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Glasgow", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "studying architecture", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "misses him a lot", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check how he's settling in", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see her next month", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t132-048", "text": "Rohan's birthday is next Saturday, 30th. Shreya's organising a surprise dinner at that Nepali place. He's mad about Liverpool, a retro shirt would go down well. Remind me to order it by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rohan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday, 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shreya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner at that Nepali place", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Liverpool", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "retro shirt would go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "order it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t132-050", "text": "Adebayo and Rachel are celebrating their tenth anniversary in a fortnight, going to Rome for a long weekend. She wants to see the Vatican, he just wants pasta.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adebayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rachel", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Rome", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a long weekend", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t132-052", "drop": true, "reason": "incoherent splice: after the Eva Moreau exhibition note it switches to an unintroduced 'he' (eleven years at the firm, not sleeping, ring him) with no referent, so owners cannot be resolved"}
{"id": "t132-053", "text": "Delroy got made redundant on Monday. They gave him two weeks notice. He's job hunting, mostly logistics roles. His wife Alina is supportive but worried about the mortgage. Need to send him the recruiter contact.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Delroy", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "job hunting", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly logistics roles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "supportive", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him the recruiter contact", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t132-054", "text": "Oliver lives just off Gloucester Road, works in insurance, very dull he says. Has a twin brother Felix who's a vet. Their mum is from Cork.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oliver", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives just off Gloucester Road", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in insurance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "dull", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "twin brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Felix", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "vet", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Cork", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t132-055", "text": "Carmen Suzuki's daughter has her first ballet recital Saturday afternoon. Carmen's more nervous than the kid. Also Carmen's started a sourdough phase, brought me a loaf.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen Suzuki", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first ballet recital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kid", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "r1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sourdough", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t132-059", "text": "Aidan's new job starts next Monday, he's head chef at a gastropub in Clapham. Super excited. Mehmet Usman used to work there. Remind me to text Aidan on Monday morning, good luck. His sister Chantal Moreau ran a restaurant there for years and is lending him her knives.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "head chef at a gastropub", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet Usman", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Aidan", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aidan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chantal Moreau", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "ran a restaurant there for years", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "job"}]}
